  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CB26121",
    "sub_id": "45750",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>期中與期末考之考試成績各佔學期總評分之30%，<br />\n隨堂小考與課程參與等綜合表現佔學期總評分之20%，<br />\n參與助教實習課程之成績佔學期總評分之20%。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "還請尊重他人，並以合理、負責和禮貌的態度行事。\n上課時請勿聊天、睡覺或做其他非本課程相關事務，除非在進行課堂討論，否則請盡量不要打擾他人。\n當其他同學報告或提問時，請專心地聆聽。當您發言時，請面對全班同學大聲說話，讓同學能聽清楚。\n助教實習課的作業與小考對學習與理解有幫助，請儘量認真參與。",
    "course_pol_en": "Please be respectful of others and behave in a reasonable, responsible and courteous manner.\nDuring class, please refrain from chatting, sleeping or engaging in activities unrelated to the course. Unless you are participating in a class discussion, please avoid disturbing others.\nWhen other students are presenting or asking questions, listen carefully. When speaking, face the class and speak loudly so that everyone can hear you.\nThe assignments and quizzes in the TA practice sessions are designed to support your learning and understanding, so please participate seriously.",
    "course_rem": "助教實習課的作業與小考對學習與理解有幫助，請儘量認真參與，\n如果你不知如何完成作業，請與授課教師或助教聯繫，切勿抄襲或作弊，我們可以一起找出幫助你的辦法。",
    "course_rem_en": "The assignments and quizzes in the TA practice sessions are for learning and understanding, so please participate seriously. \nIf you are unsure how to complete an assignment, please contact the teacher or TA rather than resorting to plagiarism or cheating. \nWe can work together to find a way to help you.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，在作業、測驗或考試中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計，若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送。</div>\n\n<div>(考核時如果您抄襲他人的答案、或交作業時您交出全部或部分由他人撰寫的論文或作業，則被視為作弊。)<br />\n&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>如果你不知如何完成作業，請與授課教師聯繫，切勿抄襲或作弊，我們可以一起找出幫助你的辦法。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Learning must be based on honesty. Any student who attempts to use a work that he has not produced as his own is considered dishonest. Students who cheat or plagiarize in homework, tests or exams, or assist others, will be scored as zero. If they are repeat offenders, they will be submitted in accordance with the rewards and punishments for students of Feng Chia University.</div>\n\n<div>If you are unsure how to complete an assignment, please contact the teacher rather than resorting to plagiarism or cheating. We can work together to find a way to help you.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
